# Phase NM1: near-miss search in the why-not kernel

**Status: draft r2, awaiting owner review; implementable once the plan and this
spec are approved.**

## Provenance

- Plan: [why-not-near-misses-plan.md](why-not-near-misses-plan.md) r2, §2.1 and
  §4 NM1.
- r1 of this spec was read in plan review round 1 as SHA-256
  `e3855ca569e890a994f015b64f5c64c651f2416f7b4e7b499ec529737913b670`; see the
  [round-1 disposition](plan-review-r1-disposition.md). r2 applies themes A, B,
  C, P and Q at the owner's direction `(p1)` (quoted in the plan). **r2 bytes
  carry no review opinion** until the confirmation round.
- Inherited: derivation-why-not WN1 spec and record (kernel, oracle, budgets),
